<b>Hei, Ayah.</b>

01:08:44.200 --> 01:08:45.070
<b>Itu dia!</b>

01:08:50.830 --> 01:08:51.960
<b>Kau tak apa-apa?</b>

01:08:52.540 --> 01:08:54.630
<b>- Ya.
